      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62d9e1390acfc147b90e3dbb|full_name} Unicode homograph attacks already allow malicious displayname duplication, and there would still hopefully be some form of disambiguation in the user interface, same as on Discord",
      "viewerReactions": null,
